WEBVTT

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:03.206
I study how to make work not suck.

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.696
In this show, I'm inviting myself
inside the minds

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:07.716
of some truly unusual people,

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:10.970
because they've mastered something
I wish everyone knew about work.

00:02:10.994 --> 00:02:13.356
(Music)

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:17.563
Today, job burnout
and why it's not inevitable.

00:02:17.587 --> 00:02:21.454
(Music)

00:02:21.478 --> 00:02:23.891
Thanks to SAP for sponsoring this episode.

00:02:23.915 --> 00:02:30.915
(Music)